y fares can't be rebooked.\n- **R-3004** \u2013 Cancelled free of charge per the passenger's note requesting a refund instead of rebooking.\n- **R-3005 (Rosa Lind, Gold, Business)** \u2013 Rebooked on AL712 (08:50\u201317:40).\n\nAll affected passengers have been notified.", "type": "text"}], "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 1731, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 4729, "output_tokens": 279, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "server_tool_use": null, "service_tier": "standard"}, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "served_model": "claude-sonnet-5", "request_id": "req_011CfWeSAgenBoARMydzYeQe"}], "trace_id": "01M3N2Z6CEFXPV3JZSJ3FX0DWS", "agentlens": {"format": "agentlens/v1", "trace_id": "01M3N2Z6CEFXPV3JZSJ3FX0DWS", "name": "episode:tools/air_stack_disruption", "started_at": "2026-09-28T22:43:03.182927Z", "ended_at": "2026-09-28T22:43:36.301933Z", "duration_ms": 33119.006, "status": "ok", "attributes": {"episode_id": "tools-air_stack_disruption-01M3N2Z6CET91F1GCXQ9YEBZ6H", "family": "tools", "task_id": "air_stack_disruption", "model": "claude-sonnet-5", "corpus": "agentlens-failure-corpus", "outcome": "pass"}, "cost_usd": 0.091424, "tokens": {"input": 12386, "output": 3410, "cache_read": 10386, "cache_write": 0}, "spans": [{"span_id": "01M3N2Z6CE2V61V8AFE82Q8TBA", "trace_id": "01M3N2Z6CEFXPV3JZSJ3FX0DWS", "parent_span_id": null, "name": "episode:tools/air_stack_disruption", "type": "agent", "status": "ok", "started_at": "2026-09-28T22:43:03.182939Z", "ended_at": "2026-09-28T22:43:36.301903Z", "duration_ms": 33118.964, "attributes": {"episode_id": "tools-air_stack_disruption-01M3N2Z6CET91F1GCXQ9YEBZ6H", "family": "tools", "task_id": "air_stack_disruption", "model": "claude-sonnet-5", "corpus": "agentlens-failure-corpus", "outcome": "pass"}, "input": {"system": "You are an airline service agent. The current time is 2026-09-06 08:00 U